":"컴퓨터를","x":181,"y":624,"width":125,"height":34},{"text":"건네면서","x":317,"y":624,"width":115,"height":32},{"text":"최종","x":446,"y":623,"width":59,"height":34},{"text":"시험","x":515,"y":623,"width":54,"height":33},{"text":"과제를","x":582,"y":624,"width":89,"height":33},{"text":"내줬는데","x":681,"y":622,"width":113,"height":34},{"text":"그","x":805,"y":627,"width":31,"height":23},{"text":"내핑은","x":845,"y":622,"width":86,"height":34},{"text":"다음과","x":940,"y":621,"width":89,"height":34},{"text":"같습니다.","x":1037,"y":621,"width":124,"height":33}]},{"text":"• CPU의 클럭 주파수는 2%Hz이다. 즉. 초당 2%개의 명령을 처리할 수 있다","words":[{"text":"•","x":234,"y":726,"width":13,"height":11},{"text":"CPU의","x":262,"y":717,"width":94,"height":28},{"text":"클럭","x":365,"y":717,"width":49,"height":28},{"text":"주파수는","x":422,"y":717,"width":101,"height":28},{"text":"2%Hz이다.","x":530,"y":717,"width":145,"height":28},{"text":"즉.","x":683,"y":717,"width":31,"height":28},{"text":"초당","x":722,"y":716,"width":51,"height":29},{"text":"2%개의","x":779,"y":717,"width":102,"height":28},{"text":"명령을","x":890,"y":716,"width":73,"height":30},{"text":"처리할","x":970,"y":714,"width":75,"height":30},{"text":"수","x":1051,"y":715,"width":26,"height":29},{"text":"있다","x":1084,"y":715,"width":55,"height":29}]},{"text":"• 컴퓨터에는 고객 30.0%명의 지난 달 구매포인트 데이터가 저장되어 있다.","words":[{"text":"•","x":235,"y":791,"width":12,"height":12},{"text":"컴퓨터에는","x":264,"y":783,"width":128,"height":29},{"text":"고객","x":398,"y":783,"width":51,"height":29},{"text":"30.0%명의","x":458,"y":784,"width":144,"height":29},{"text":"지난","x":611,"y":783,"width":49,"height":29},{"text":"달","x":668,"y":783,"width":26,"height":28},{"text":"구매포인트","x":700,"y":783,"width":124,"height":28},{"text":"데이터가","x":833,"y":782,"width":97,"height":29},{"text":"저장되어","x":937,"y":782,"width":96,"height":29},{"text":"있다.","x":1042,"y":782,"width":54,"height":29}]},{"text":"• 매월 14일에는 구매포인트 상위 14.142번째 고객에게 커피 상품권을 주는 14142(하나 사고 해나 사니 들)","words":[{"text":"•","x":235,"y":857,"width":12,"